{"id":"26462d7874ea19c4","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring.md","title":"ZFC Algebra2 Polynomial Ring","display":"df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring — ZFC Algebra2 Polynomial Ring","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring","aliases":["58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring"],"display":"df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring — ZFC Algebra2 Polynomial Ring","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring — ZFC Algebra2 Polynomial Ring"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,X,P,0_R\\in V\">\\(R,X,P,0_R\\in V\\)</span>（系数载体、变元集、多项式载体与指定零元）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mon}_X\">\\(\\operatorname{Mon}_X\\)</span>（有限支撑函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\to\\omega\">\\(X\\to\\omega\\)</span> 的集合，即交换单项式集合）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{0_R}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}_{0_R}(f)\\)</span>（函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_R\">\\(0_R\\)</span> 的非零支撑）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2PolynomialRing}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2PolynomialRing}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（此处定义的多项式载体谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}monomial\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{Mon}_X\\coloneqq\\left\\{m\\in\\omega^X:\\left|\\{x\\in X:m(x)\\neq0\\}\\right|\\in\\omega\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}monomial\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{Mon}_X\\coloneqq\\left\\{m\\in\\omega^X:\\left|\\{x\\in X:m(x)\\neq0\\}\\right|\\in\\omega\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}coefficient\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\operatorname{supp}_{0_R}(f)\\coloneqq\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(m)\\neq0_R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}coefficient\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\operatorname{supp}_{0_R}(f)\\coloneqq\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(m)\\neq0_R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2PolynomialRing}_S(P,R,X,0_R)\\leftrightarrow0_R\\in R\\land P=\\left\\{f\\in R^{\\operatorname{Mon}_X}:\\left|\\operatorname{supp}_{0_R}(f)\\right|\\in\\omega\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2PolynomialRing}_S(P,R,X,0_R)\\leftrightarrow0_R\\in R\\land P=\\left\\{f\\in R^{\\operatorname{Mon}_X}:\\left|\\operatorname{supp}_{0_R}(f)\\right|\\in\\omega\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该谓词定义形式多项式的载体；加法与乘法分别由系数逐点相加和卷积给出，需另行携带系数环运算。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,X,P,0_R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mon}_X","display":false},{"tex":"X\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}_{0_R}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"0_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2PolynomialRing}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}monomial\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{Mon}_X\\coloneqq\\left\\{m\\in\\omega^X:\\left|\\{x\\in X:m(x)\\neq0\\}\\right|\\in\\omega\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}coefficient\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\operatorname{supp}_{0_R}(f)\\coloneqq\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(m)\\neq0_R\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2PolynomialRing}_S(P,R,X,0_R)\\leftrightarrow0_R\\in R\\land P=\\left\\{f\\in R^{\\operatorname{Mon}_X}:\\left|\\operatorname{supp}_{0_R}(f)\\right|\\in\\omega\\right\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1485,"backlinks":[{"id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"The arbitrary-variable carrier in [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-algebra2-polynomial-ring.md]] has the same underlying set when $X=n\\in\\omega$ (with $\\mathbb N=\\omega$): every exponent map $n\\to\\mathbb N$ already has finite support."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1427","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-z